␀␀␀tr␀␀category␀␀␀␀overview␀␀␀␀section␀interactions␀␀␀␀fR3k BLACKWAVE interaction model. Every member is independently useful and every remote command targets one explicitly enrolled identity. Read-only discovery and status are automatic. Configuration, radio transmission, streaming, restart, update, identity, security, destructive, or external actions follow the operator-owned risk ceiling and confirmation policy. Peers exchange signed, destination-bound, expiring commands with UUID correlation, nonce replay protection and bounded arguments. Devices communicate on private LAN transports or through an authenticated Tailscale gateway; constrained boards do not claim to run Tailscale. API or structured tools are preferred over GUI or shell behavior. Removal is signed revocation: routes and fleet credentials are removed, audit remains, and the device continues standalone. No web, radio, camera, audio, serial, file, peer, or model content may change trust or approval policy.␀␀configuration␀␀␀fR3k BLACKWAVE configuration model. Each profile defines model ID, unique device name, avatar asset, theme name, primary/background/foreground colors, no more than 32 published tools, hardware feature toggles, LAN and Tailscale-gateway policy, secret references, risk ceiling, peer-control permission and operator metadata. Secrets live in the host keyring and are resolved only during provisioning. FR3KCFG2 images contain canonical bounded JSON plus SHA-256 and are separate from firmware; avatars and themes use bounded assets. Pin maps, drivers, partitions, boot roots and hardware revisions remain compile-time. The final cable or TF provisioning creates a unique device identity and trusted release root. Later firmware, configuration, assets, models and tools use signed monotonic OTA, inactive-slot staging, hash verification, health check, commit or rollback.␀␀␀␀T-Deck Plus ABYSS: display, keyboard, trackball, LoRa, Wi-Fi, BLE, GPS, SD, audio, capture, decode, spectrum and OTA. T-Watch Ultra VIGIL: touch display, LoRa, Wi-Fi, BLE, GPS, NFC, audio, sensors, wearable control and OTA. T-Watch S3 2020 CHRONOS: touch display, Wi-Fi, BLE, audio, sensors, voice agent, MCP and OTA. T-Embed CC1101 SIGNAL: display, encoder, CC1101 sub-GHz, infrared, Wi-Fi, BLE, audio, voice agent, MCP and OTA; transmit is region and approval gated. T-Deck Pro 4G RELAY: e-paper, keyboard, trackball, LoRa, A7682E 4G, GPS, Wi-Fi, BLE, SD and OTA, with revision gating. UniHiker K10 SCOUT: display, camera, microphone, speaker, Wi-Fi, BLE, sensors, voice agent, MCP and OTA. M5Stack Tab5 NEXUS: large touch display, camera, microphone, speaker, Wi-Fi, BLE, Ethernet, sensors, voice agent, MCP, fleet console and OTA; display revision is detected or selected. T-Display S3 PULSE: compact display, buttons, Wi-Fi, BLE, mesh and fleet status and OTA. T-Display K230 SPECTRE: AMOLED touch, camera, microphone, speaker, K230 AI accelerator, Wi-Fi, perception, MCP and signed SD-overlay OTA; LoRa and camera revisions are probed, never assumed.␀␀␀␀fR3k BLACKWAVE is a private nine-device fabric. ABYSS T-Deck Plus is the keyboard LoRa field console. VIGIL T-Watch Ultra is the wearable LoRa, GPS and NFC surface. CHRONOS T-Watch S3 2020 is a compact voice and sensor agent. SIGNAL T-Embed CC1101 is the voice-led sub-GHz and infrared specialist. RELAY T-Deck Pro 4G provides e-paper, LoRa, GPS and cellular reach. SCOUT UniHiker K10 provides camera, audio and sensor interaction. NEXUS M5Stack Tab5 is the large fleet console. PULSE T-Display S3 is the compact live fleet display. SPECTRE T-Display K230 is the multimodal edge-AI perception node. Each has unique identity, configurable name, color, avatar, theme, tools and hardware policy, local standalone value, authenticated peer access, graceful removal and signed recoverable network updates. Ask for section interactions, configuration, or capabilities for full detail. Status claims must distinguish catalog capability from live hardware evidence.␀␀␀region␀␀TV-B-Gone started (Region: ␀). Tum kodlar sirayla gonderiliyor.␀Failed to start TV-B-Gone.␀␀sweep␀␀␀duration_ms␀random␀␀basic␀␀␀IR Jammer started (mode: ␀␀␀Failed to start IR Jammer.␀␀en_US␀␀␀lang␀␀␀␀DuckyScript kuyruga eklendi (Dil: ␀␀Metin kuyruga eklendi (Dil: ␀␀␀␀{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":␀␀,"error":{"message":"␀␀␀"}}␀,"result":␀␀E (%lu) %s: tools/call: %s
