␀blackwave_fleet␀Explain the complete fR3k BLACKWAVE fleet. Use section overview, capabilities, interactions, or configuration.␀␀self.get_device_status␀␀Provides the real-time information of the device, including the current status of the audio speaker, screen, battery, network, etc.
Use this tool for: 
1. Answering questions about current condition (e.g. what is the current volume of the audio speaker?)
2. As the first step to control the device (e.g. turn up / down the volume of the audio speaker, etc.)␀␀␀self.audio_speaker.set_volume␀␀␀Set the volume of the audio speaker. If the current volume is unknown, you must call `self.get_device_status` tool first and then call this tool.␀␀␀self.screen.set_brightness␀␀Set the brightness of the screen.␀␀␀self.screen.set_theme␀␀␀Set the theme of the screen. The theme can be `light` or `dark`.␀␀␀␀self.screen.play_url␀␀␀␀Play a LAN MJPEG/JPEG stream in the top half of the Tab5 screen. URL must be http://<private-ipv4>/... (YouTube must be transcoded by the LAN caster first).␀␀␀␀self.screen.stop_play␀␀␀Stop the Tab5 top-half video cast and restore the info panels.␀␀self.camera.take_photo␀␀Always remember you have a camera. If the user asks you to see something, use this tool to take a photo and then explain it.
Args:
  `question`: The question that you want to ask about the photo.
Return:
  A JSON object that provides the photo information.␀␀␀␀self.cc1101.execute␀CC1101 Sub-GHz master tool. Executes the specified action.
Supported actions:
  'get_info': Get module status
  'set_freq': Set freq (param: 'mhz' int 300-928)
  'set_mod': Set modulation (param: 'type' string 'ASK'|'FSK')
  'read_rssi': Read signal strength
  'load_presets': Load presets from SD (param: 'path' string, default '/sdcard/cc1101_presets.json')
  'replay': Replay .sub file after explicit confirmation (param: 'filename')
  'stop_replay': Stop ongoing replay
  'tesla_port': Transmit a bounded test signal after explicit authorization and confirmation
  'save_raw': Save last capture (param: 'filepath' string, optional)
  'start_jammer': Disabled by BLACKWAVE safety policy
  'stop_jammer': Stop RF jammer␀␀␀action␀␀mhz␀filename␀␀␀␀filepath␀␀␀␀confirmed␀␀␀self.ir.replay_file␀Send an infrared command from a .ir file on the SD card.
Flipper Zero / Bruce uyumlu format desteklenir (NEC, RC5, RC6, Samsung32, SIRC, RAW).
Ornekler: ir.replay_file({file: 'tv.ir', command: 'Power'})
  - file: Name or full path of .ir file (e.g. 'samsung_tv.ir' or '/sdcard/ir/tv.ir')
  - command: gondermek istediginiz komut adi. Bos birakilirsa ilk komut gonderilir.␀file␀␀␀␀self.ir.tv_b_gone␀␀␀TV-B-Gone: TÃ¼m bilinen TV markalarinin guc kapama kodlarini sirayla gonderir.
Etraftaki TV'leri, projektÃ¶rleri ve ekranlari kapatmak icin kullanilir.
Call self.ir.stop_tv_b_gone to stop it.
Parametre: region ('eu' (Avrupa) veya 'us' (Amerika/Asya) olarak belirtilmelidir).␀␀self.ir.stop_tv_b_gone␀␀Stop ongoing TV-B-Gone operation.␀␀␀self.ir.start_jammer␀␀␀␀Start IR Jammer: Prevents IR receiver devices from being controlled remotely.
Modlar: 'basic' (38kHz sabit), 'sweep' (33-56kHz tarama), 'random' (rastgele)
  - mode: 'basic' | 'sweep' | 'random' (varsayilan: 'sweep')
  - duration_ms: calisma suresi ms (0 = surekli, maks 300000)␀␀self.ir.stop_jammer␀Aktif IR Jammer'i durdur.␀␀␀news.get_top_headlines␀␀Get the latest top headlines from NewsAPI.org. Use this when the user asks for news.
Parameters:
  - country: The 2-letter ISO 3166-1 code of the country (e.g., 'tr' for Turkey, 'us' for USA, 'gb' for UK). Default is 'tr'.
  - category: The category you want to get headlines for. Options: business, entertainment, general, health, science, sports, technology. Leave empty for all categories.
Returns a formatted string containing the top headlines.␀␀␀self.sdcard.list_files␀␀List all files on SD card (.sub, .json, .txt etc.) with labels.
To see available files before replay or loading preset kullan.
Shows labels by file type: [sub], [csv], [json], [txt], [folder], [file]␀self.sdcard.list_sub_files␀␀List only .sub files on SD card. Use this before calling replay_sub_file to get the exact filenames available for replay.␀␀␀self.sdcard.list_directory␀␀List all files and folders in a directory on the SD card.␀␀␀self.sdcard.create_folder␀␀␀Create a new folder on the SD card.␀self.sdcard.delete␀␀Delete a file or an empty folder on the SD card.␀␀␀␀self.sdcard.read_text␀␀␀Read a text file (TXT, JSON, CSV) from the SD card. Maximum ~10KB recommended to avoid OOM.␀self.sdcard.write_text␀␀Write text content to a file on the SD card. Overwrites existing file.␀␀self.sdcard.copy␀␀␀␀Copy a file from source to destination on the SD card.␀␀self.sdcard.get_hash␀␀␀␀Get the MD5 hash of a file on the SD card to verify integrity.␀␀self.usb.bad_usb_run␀␀␀␀Hedef cihaza komutlar gondermek icin DuckyScript calistirir.
Ornek script: GUI r\nDELAY 100\nSTRING cmd\nENTER
Komutlar asenkron olarak arka planda calistirilir (Wi-Fi ve mikrofon aktif kalir).
Parametre: script (DuckyScript), lang (isteÄŸe baÄŸlÄ±, varsayÄ±lan: 'en_US')␀self.usb.bad_usb_type␀␀␀Hedef bilgisayara dogrudan metin yazar. DuckyScript olmadan duz metin tuslamak icin kullanilir.
